{"id": "52d15994-2f45-4318-9dd7-04d0b73662c1", "name": "検査時SOC算出制約", "description": "出荷下限SOCから、工程滞留による自己放電量のばらつきを差し引くことで検査時の下限SOCを算出する。(出荷下限SOC-(自己放電±3σ×工程滞留温度・期間) =検査時SOCばらつき) に基づく。", "inputNames": ["shipping_lower_limit_soc", "self_discharge_variance", "storage_duration"], "outputNames": ["inspection_soc_min"], "parameters": {}, "code": "inspection_soc_min = shipping_lower_limit_soc - (self_discharge_variance * storage_duration)", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T11:36:05.611602", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
