{"id": "b674a5d1-8fb6-435d-a1ad-cb584a79f129", "name": "自己放電特性ばらつき制約", "description": "自己放電マップにおける代表値(CEN)と標準偏差(σ)から、特性のばらつき範囲を規定する±3σ（スリーシグマ）およびその上限値・下限値を算出します。", "inputNames": ["cen", "sigma"], "outputNames": ["three_sigma", "cen_upper_limit", "cen_lower_limit"], "parameters": {}, "code": "three_sigma = 3 * sigma\ncen_upper_limit = cen + three_sigma\ncen_lower_limit = cen - three_sigma", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T11:39:11.224657", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
